# repos.manifest — the services that make up the system, and the shared slice branch.
#
# ACTIVE_BRANCH  <branch>          the branch every repo sits on for the current vertical slice
# <name>  <remote-url>             one line per service repo
#
# Edit ACTIVE_BRANCH via `./scripts/sync-branches.sh <branch>` (it rewrites this line), not by hand.

ACTIVE_BRANCH  launch/quicktricks-v2

livestream        https://github.com/raghav-hranker/livestream.git
nodejs-server     https://github.com/raghav-hranker/nodejs-server.git
video-transcoder  https://github.com/raghav-hranker/video-transcoder.git
admin-dashboard   https://github.com/raghav-hranker/admin-dashboard.git
ls                https://github.com/raghav-hranker/ls.git

# ops-console  https://github.com/raghav-hranker/ops-console.git
#   Phone-first monitoring (Uptime Kuma + Telegram bot) on the OCI bastion. Local: ../ops-console, branch main.
#   Not a slice repo: never slice-synced. Plan: docs/plans/ops-console.md.
#
# ---- Deploy forks (commented on purpose: NOT branch-synced, excluded from sync-branches.sh) ----
# The client team cloned our repos as SEPARATE repos (not branches), so the production line
# lives in forks that follow their own branch discipline and are merged by agreement.
#
# quicktricks-backend  https://github.com/abhi092515/quicktricks-backend.git
#   The PRODUCTION LMS (fork of nodejs-server + their admin features, merged 2026-08-13).
#   Local: ../quicktricks-backend, branch quicktricks-admin (their line — never slice-synced).
#   Prod: https://backend.quicktricksbysahilsir.com -> shared Hranker box webserver2-2, pm2 quicktricks-backend.
#   (quicktricks.multistreaming.site on the test-uday box is a separate, non-production deploy.)
#   nodejs-server remains the upstream lineage + the phonetics standby deploy.
#
# quicktricks-admin  https://github.com/abhi092515/quicktricks-admin.git
#   The client team's admin-dashboard fork (separate cloned repo, not a branch).
#   Their line: branch quicktricks-admin — same discipline as the backend fork:
#   merged by agreement, never slice-synced. Deploy: Vercel on push -> admin.quicktricksbysahilsir.com.
#
# thedhronas  git@github.com:GontinaUdayKumar/thedhronas.git
#   The STUDENT-FACING website (Next.js) — the client team's white-label repo:
#   ONE BRANCH PER CUSTOMER (~330 tenant branches); the quicktricks line is branch
#   quicktricksbysahilsir-new. Local: ../thedhronas. Never slice-synced.
#   Live-class surface: pages/user/video-chat + video-notes-chat, socket hook
#   src/lib/hooks/useSocket.ts — as of 2026-08-24 still LEGACY (anonymous connect,
#   no realtime-token mint): the blocker for REALTIME_AUTH_REQUIRED=true.
